      "writtenOn": "2024-03-04T16:03:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The back and forth with pkvm.c is a bit strange.\n\nHow about you have a top level function in pkvm.c that handles the ... `pkvm_handle_t` and then call `__pkvm_guest_stage2_snapshot` ?\n\nI don\u0027t think mem_protect should issue any knowledge about `pkvm_handle_t`",
      "revId": "087f3c1e68b34dc5e8b60195a961e8862fafd028",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
